  "code": "class Solution:\n    def mergeTrees(self, root1, root2):\n        # 先说明变量含义，再完成你的实现\n                \n        def dfs(p,q):\n            if p is None and q is None:\n                return None\n            if p is None and q is not None:\n                return q    \n            if p and q is None:\n                return p\n            if p and q:\n                p.val+=q.val\n                p.left = dfs(p.left,q.left)\n                p.right = dfs(p.right,q.right)\n                return p\n\n\n        return dfs(root1,root2)\n",
